  "type": "draft-issue",
  "title": "Deep Learning Hypoglycemia Prediction & Smart Alert System",
  "body": "## Summary\nBuild a system to predict hypoglycemic events using deep learning and notify users/caregivers with smart alerts.\n\n## Requirements\n- Integrate with CGM and wearable data sources\n- Preprocess time-series and contextual data\n- Implement LSTM/Transformer model for prediction\n- Real-time risk scoring and event forecasting\n- Smart alert engine (context-aware notifications, escalation)\n- User interface (dashboard, alerts history)\n- Feedback loop for continuous improvement\n\n## Milestones\n1. Data pipeline & preprocessing prototype\n2. Baseline deep learning model (LSTM)\n3. Real-time prediction integration\n4. Alert logic & notification system\n5. User interface & dashboard\n6. User feedback integration\n7. Clinical validation & documentation\n\n---\n_Assignee: AnnagiriPeddiraju_"
}